  "description": "Erection of an outbuilding for use as office/artist studio in back garden. Single story, high pitch Malvern Garden Buildings studio apex pavilion, 3.66 meters wide, 6.1 meters long, 2.04 meters to eves, pitched roof total height 2.93 meters. High quality, British handmade, fully lined, insulated and double glazed garden room made from sustainably sourced Scandinavian redwood. Clad in 13mm tongue and groove redwood painted dark blue (Malvern colour Ocean Blue). The roof is covered in dark grey Tapco slate effect tiles. The gable end facing the garden features a double glazed 2 x 10ft by 12 ft Gable end window, the other gable end has a 41in. fixed double glazed window. There are three 28in. privacy vent windows at the rear of the studio. To the front of the studio  (which would be facing our house) there are four double glazed 3/4 length fixed windows and double doors with 3/4 length fixed windows.  \n\nTo be erected on a concrete base.\n\nAs part of the landscaping we would propose to move one tree (T3) to a different location, and to plant a wildlife friendly hedge, so that the building and our neighbours enjoy privacy.",
